@0    = ~Nice to see some faces that look like they've a hankering for some action! Just give me a moment to get down from here...~ [C0BLANK]
@1    = ~Ha ha, did you like my little display of acrobatics? I apologize if my presence on the roof shocked you.~ [C0BLANK]
@2    = ~That's alright. Might I know your name, though?~
@3    = ~Quite a singing voice you have.~
@4    = ~Who are you, gnome, and why should I care?~
@5    = ~I'm sorry, but I really don't have the time to talk to you.~
@6    = ~Minerva. Minerva Glimmershine, wandering artificer and thrill-seeker extraordinaire, all the way from Lantan. Occasionally, I dabble in a little bit of rooftop performance, as you've seen.~
@7    = ~Well, thank you! You're certainly a more appreciative audience than the folk I've met on the road. Of course, most of those were orcs and goblins.~
@8    = ~That aside, however, allow me to introduce myself.~
@9    = ~Now then, let's have a look at you... you're the adventurers who arrived recently, yep? If I'm not mistaken—and rarely I am, that long-legged Hrothgar who just left the tavern asked something that only someone with a little bit of experience in the wild can handle. Whatever it is—and if it's not too much trouble, that is, I'd like to join in.~
@10   = ~Now then, let's have a look at you... you're the adventurer that arrived recently, yep? Hmm, wow... just the one of you? I didn't think I'd find another lone wanderer in these parts.~
@11   = ~If I'm not mistaken—and rarely I am, that long-legged Hrothgar who just left the tavern asked something that only someone with a little bit of experience in the wild can handle. Whatever it is—and if it's not too much trouble, that is, I'd like to join in.~
@12   = ~I'm a good hand with knives, traps, potions... standard fare for any student of Lantanese arts. Well, minus the knife-throwing. I picked that one up on my own. And I'm good... very good. If you don't believe me, I can demonstrate right—well, perhaps not right now.~
@13   = ~But suffice to say, I've got more than enough skill to make my company worth your while. That being said, you can do as you please.~
@14   = ~I'd be happy to have you join me, Minerva.~
@15   = ~I've got no more room for new companions, sadly.~
@16   = ~I've got all the company I need at the moment.~
@17   = ~I'd rather travel alone for the time being.~
@18   = ~No way. Beat it, gnome.~
@19   = ~Oh, splendiferous! A picnic of trout and cheese on a rooftop is well and good, but hardly a loss when great adventures await! You won't regret this.~
@20   = ~Oh well, it is what it is, I suppose. I suppose I can't keep on talking if no one's listening. Tell you what, though, if you're ever interested in some more company, I'll be at the Snowdrift inn for the time being.~
@21   = ~Hello there! Is this just a friendly visit, or do you need something from me? I'm itching for an adventure.~ [C0BLANK]
@22   = ~Gladly!~
@23   = ~And I thought travelling alone was bad! I'd be happier on my own.~
@24   = ~Oh, is that it? Do you need me to take a break for a while?~
@25   = ~No, I made a mistake. Stay.~
@26   = ~Wait here for now.~
@27   = ~I'll meet you at the Snowdrift Inn.~
@28   = ~Go back to Easthaven for now. I'll meet you at the Snowdrift Inn.~
@29   = ~I'll meet you at the Evening Shade.~
@30   = ~Go back to Kuldahar for now. I'll meet you at the Evening Shade.~
@31   = ~Oh, hello there! Have you come to pick me up?~
@32   = ~Yes, join me.~
@33   = ~No, not yet.~
@34   = ~I'll be back for you later.~
